<p>From about 1000 CPU seconds to about 650 CPU seconds.  Think of all the electricity we&#8217;ll be saving, all over the world, from machines sweating less when building Emacs.</p>
<p>It might be as much as half an NFT!  Globally!  Over several lifetimes!</p>
